      {
        "text": "The decline of industrial communities has caused lasting harm to individual identity and collective cohesion.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Economic elites prioritize financial metrics over social and psychological well-being.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Material progress alone cannot compensate for the erosion of shared purpose and community.",
